  "story": {
    "day": 167,
    "title": "Kaya's Kitchen Memories",
    "sentences": [
      "It was a free holiday. Kaya felt such joy.",
      "She decided to make curry. It was her fourth time.",
      "She did research online for the best recipe.",
      "She took a photograph of a slice of potato and carrot.",
      "Her finger pointed to the ingredients. She added cabbage and lettuce.",
      "She measured an ounce of seasoning. Because it'll be tasty!",
      "Why was it important? He'll borrow a cookbook later.",
      "She remembered skiing once. Her leg and knee felt sore.",
      "She stretched her neck. Were there sheep at that resort?",
      "She recalled the amusement park and a rope swing she tried to climb.",
      "She saw a dolphin toy and an an octopus plushie twice there.",
      "The main course was warm curry, steak, or spaghetti. For dessert, pudding."
    ]
  }
